*** Keywords ***
Feature 1514 Enabled
    [Documentation]   Auther:jingmin.he@nokia-sbell.com
    ...   Check if feature 1514 is enabled in current package.
    [Arguments]   ${host}=${tl.gnbs[0].cu.oam_ssh_connection_details.addr}
    ...           ${username}=${tl.gnbs[0].cu.oam_ssh_connection_details.username}
    ...           ${password}=${tl.gnbs[0].cu.oam_ssh_connection_details.password}
    ...           ${connection}=release_info
    ${connection_status}   Run Keyword and Return Status   csn.Get Connection By Alias   alias=${connection}
    Run Keyword Unless   ${connection_status}   csn.Connect To
    ...   hostname=${host}   username=${username}   password=${password}   alias=${connection}
    ${res}   feature_1514_opened   connection=${connection}
    [Return]   ${res}
    [Teardown]   Run Keyword Unless   ${connection_status}   csn.Disconnect   connection=${connection}
